    "description": "!! This file is designed to be read, not required; these are templates for copy/pasting and testing/making your own quasi resamplers; it is not advised to 'require' this file directly !! Why: There is no native resampling in gen~, which poses a real problem. This file includes various basic cubic interpolation hacks. First are one in one out interpolators for memoryless non-linearities. Then the same for two inputs one output. Finally there are versions which can be used for nonlinear filters. Comments in the code detail how it is done.",
